{"id":"0c6fbc9920c55fb6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/049_Hilbert_公理演算.md","title":"049 Hilbert 公理演算","display":"049_Hilbert_公理演算","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["formal-system","ZFC","repaired"],"system_id":"049","audit_status":"core_rewritten","source_sha256":"36f1f639c6c2b8fd0c13149fcc6be8fd3d4ff955cee576e08432915e2293b645"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>formal-system</span><span>ZFC</span><span>repaired</span></div>"},{"key":"system_id","html":"049"},{"key":"audit_status","html":"core_rewritten"},{"key":"source_sha256","html":"36f1f639c6c2b8fd0c13149fcc6be8fd3d4ff955cee576e08432915e2293b645"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"049-·-Hilbert-公理演算-·-严格-ZFC-核心\">049 · Hilbert 公理演算 · 严格 ZFC 核心</h1>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"important\"><div class=\"callout-title\">验收状态</div><p>规范核心已改写；尚无整套元理论内核证明。正文的规范部分是下表指向的有限公式；说明文字不是增加元语言原语的许可证。原始代码格式已变，不能直接重用旧证明代码。逐项状态见 <a href=\"?unresolved=000_AUDIT%2F%E9%80%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%2F%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5_049\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-1\" data-link-target=\"000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_049\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_049<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"1.-版本与参数\">1. 版本与参数</h2>\n<p>公式语言为 CPC，但公理集 A 与有限规则关系 R 是任意给定集合参数。</p>\n<p>规则前提是有限序列；零前提规则合法。兼容二值赋值是明确选定的附加语义，并非任意 Hilbert 参数的唯一或完备语义。只有公理/规则成员资格有效时才有有效证书检查器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-规范公式入口\">2. 规范公式入口</h2>\n<p>每个名称及全部缩写依赖，都有独立 Obsidian 页面，页面 <code>zfc</code> 代码块给出完整的一阶公式。参数全部是集合变量；例如 <code>(@ FmC t)</code> 是公式缩写，不是把命题逻辑加入元语言。<code>z</code> 加数字的参数名只是生成时选取的普通变量名，无特殊语义。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"558cfa8109ae83cc\" href=\"?note=558cfa8109ae83cc\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertParams\">HilbertParams</a></td>\n<td><code>A, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d7998f1fb04da430\" href=\"?note=d7998f1fb04da430\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertProof\">HilbertProof</a></td>\n<td><code>A, R, g, z4835, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9c644b9628ec606\" href=\"?note=c9c644b9628ec606\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertProv\">HilbertProv</a></td>\n<td><code>A, R, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd3ac967350e3362\" href=\"?note=dd3ac967350e3362\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertCompatible\">HilbertCompatible</a></td>\n<td><code>A, R, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc8424d7afc22e4d\" href=\"?note=cc8424d7afc22e4d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertConseq\">HilbertConseq</a></td>\n<td><code>A, R, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d4238504f9a97862\" href=\"?note=d4238504f9a97862\" title=\"000_ZFC/02_proofs\">000_ZFC/02_proofs</a>。纯语言约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">000_ZFC/01_language</a>，有限证明列的读法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d4238504f9a97862\" href=\"?note=d4238504f9a97862\" title=\"000_ZFC/02_proofs\">000_ZFC/02_proofs</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3.-正确性核对与未完成义务\">3. 正确性核对与未完成义务</h2>\n<p>语言闭包已由静态检查：只允许集合变量作项，非逻辑原子只有 <code>=</code> 与 <code>in</code>，全部缩写有声明、无环、无意外自由变量。此结论<strong>不等于</strong> ZFC 已证明本系统的一般可靠性、完备性、保型性或与同名标准版本的等价。</p>\n<p>定义层书面核对、算法结构下降及反例回归的适用范围见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。本篇不适用的类型检查义务不会被虚构为一个名为 Check 的空洞接口；适用的检查器与声明式推导分开定义。</p>\n<p>修复前的逐字文本保存在 <code>000_AUDIT/原稿快照/049_Hilbert_公理演算.md.txt</code>，只作历史证据，不参与新版缩写展开。全量未通过项见 <a href=\"?unresolved=000_AUDIT%2F03_%E5%BE%85%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-11\" data-link-target=\"000_AUDIT/03_待修改报告\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">000_AUDIT/03_待修改报告<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"049-·-Hilbert-公理演算-·-严格-ZFC-核心","text":"049 · Hilbert 公理演算 · 严格 ZFC 核心","level":1},{"id":"1.-版本与参数","text":"1. 版本与参数","level":2},{"id":"2.-规范公式入口","text":"2. 规范公式入口","level":2},{"id":"3.-正确性核对与未完成义务","text":"3. 正确性核对与未完成义务","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_049","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"049 · Hilbert 公理演算 · 严格 ZFC 核心","excerpt":"[!important] 验收状态\n规范核心已改写；尚无整套元理论内核证明。正文的规范部分是下表指向的有限公式；说明文字不是增加元语言原语的许可证。原始代码格式已变，不能直接重用旧证明代码。逐项状态见 [[000_AUDIT/逐文件/审查_049]]。","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertParams","status":"resolved","id":"558cfa8109ae83cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertProof","status":"resolved","id":"d7998f1fb04da430","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertProof|HilbertProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertProv","status":"resolved","id":"c9c644b9628ec606","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertProv|HilbertProv]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertCompatible","status":"resolved","id":"dd3ac967350e3362","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertConseq","status":"resolved","id":"cc8424d7afc22e4d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 规范公式入口","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertConseq|HilbertConseq]]","embed":false}